OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry for most
OL,6,Fbut a few heavy showers around this
OL,7,Fevening, mainly in the east. Mostly
OL,8,Fcloudy but clear spells later in the
OL,9,Fnight with some low cloud and mist.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA cloudy start then bright
OL,12,For sunny spells developing. Mostly dry
OL,13,Fbut the odd shower is possible, these
OL,14,Fturning heavier in the evening.
OL,15,FFeeling warm in any sunshine.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain or
OL,18,Fshowers at times, perhaps heavy and
OL,19,Fthundery. Occasional drier and
OL,20,Fbrighter spells. Light or moderate
OL,21,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
